              wikipedia:
              %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angular_velocity"} angular velocity
          %p
            The more general discussion in terms of
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bivector"} bivector
